{
 "description": "RPG_BAT.EXN, the school trip's mock RPG battles: lines, centered move names, the damage fragments (joined by 0x8014D11C as name + ': ' + number + ' damage taken'), loot, titles and the pun list (English puns). Verified in DuckStation, hidden emulator (docs/testing.md 'Overlay words and small files'): the habu battle from Yuina's Okinawa trip (force_trip.py, 'leave this to me'): the boss and helper names, damage/heal composition, the player's lines (their opening 「 restored after the run), the loot line. The 攻撃/防御 command menu is graphics and stays Japanese. Checked only statically: the bear and alien battles' lines, other moves.",
 "strings": [
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x289A0",
   "original": "朝日奈「つまんな〜い！",
   "text": "Asahina: Boooring!"
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x289E0",
   "original": "　　　　　ナイアガラダンク　　　　　",
   "text": "             Niagara Dunk             "
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x28A60",
   "original": "マタギ「こったらとこ来たらだめだべ！",
   "text": "Hunter: Ya can't come 'round here!"
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x28A88",
   "original": "早くけえれ！",
   "text": "Git home!"
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x28A98",
   "original": "　　　　サーモンブーメラン　　　　",
   "text": "         Salmon Boomerang         "
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x28ABC",
   "original": "「だめだ！　喰われてしまう！",
   "text": "「No good! It'll eat me!"
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x28ADC",
   "original": "くそったれめー！",
   "text": "Damn it all!"
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x28AF0",
   "original": "正義のマタギ見参！",
   "text": "Justice Hunter!"
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x28B04",
   "original": "名銃「次郎丸」ショット",
   "text": "Jiromaru Rifle Shot"
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x28B1C",
   "original": "「次郎丸」エネルギー充填",
   "text": "「Jiromaru charging up"
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x28B38",
   "original": "戦闘に勝った！！",
   "text": "Battle won!!"
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x28B4C",
   "original": "ありがとう、マタギのおじさん",
   "text": "Thanks, Mister Hunter"
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x28B6C",
   "original": "経験値　：１０２４ＥＸＰ",
   "text": "EXP  : 1024 EXP"
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x28B88",
   "original": "お金　　：５３ゴールド",
   "text": "Money: 53 Gold"
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x28C30",
   "original": "好雄「いくぞっ！",
   "text": "Yoshio: Here goes!"
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x28C44",
   "original": "スペシャル好雄パーンチ！",
   "text": "Special Yoshio Punch!"
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x28C60",
   "original": "好雄「食らえ！",
   "text": "Yoshio: Eat!"
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x28C70",
   "original": "グレート好雄キーック！",
   "text": "Great Yoshio Kiiick!"
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x28C88",
   "original": "　　　　　　好雄の秘薬　　　　　　",
   "text": "         Yoshio's Elixir          "
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x28D30",
   "original": "藤崎「もう、",
   "text": "Fujisaki: Oh,"
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x28D40",
   "original": "なにバカなこと言ってるのよ。",
   "text": "don't be silly!"
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x28D90",
   "original": "　　　　ハーメルンのホラ吹き　　　　",
   "text": "          Pied Piper's Fibs           "
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x28E20",
   "original": "美樹原「きゃっ！",
   "text": "Mikihara: Eek!"
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x28E34",
   "original": "美樹原「はっ！",
   "text": "Mikihara: Hah!"
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x28EB0",
   "original": "早乙女「えーん",
   "text": "Saotome: Waaah"
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x28EC0",
   "original": "えーん（うそなき）",
   "text": "Waaah (fake cry)"
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x28ED4",
   "original": "不良達「これはいかん！",
   "text": "Thugs: This won't do!"
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x28EEC",
   "original": "女子供を泣かせては、男がすたる。",
   "text": "Making a girl cry? A man's shame."
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x28F10",
   "original": "番長「いっか〜ん！",
   "text": "Boss: No good!"
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x28F24",
   "original": "女子供を泣かせては、番長の名折れ！",
   "text": "Making a girl cry shames a boss!"
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x28FA0",
   "original": "紐緒「馬鹿な事言ってるんじゃないわ",
   "text": "Himoo: Don't talk nonsense."
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x29010",
   "original": "　　　　　　メガトン辞書　　　　　　",
   "text": "          Megaton Dictionary          "
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x29070",
   "original": "虹野「がんばってっ！",
   "text": "Nijino: Go for it!"
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x29160",
   "original": "不良「そんな攻撃では、",
   "text": "Thug: Hits like that"
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x29178",
   "original": "俺達の拳とは語れねぇぜ！",
   "text": "won't talk to our fists!"
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x29194",
   "original": "不良「口ほどにもないやつめ。",
   "text": "Thug: All talk, no fight."
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x291B4",
   "original": "出直してきやがれ！",
   "text": "Come back later!"
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x291C8",
   "original": "不良「くっ！　なかなかやるなっ！",
   "text": "Thug: Ugh! You're not bad!"
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x291EC",
   "original": "しかたねぇ、番長様に御報告だ！",
   "text": "Gotta report to the Boss!"
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x2920C",
   "original": "？？「ちょっと待てぇーい！",
   "text": "??: Hold it right there!"
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x29228",
   "original": "番長「俺様は、この世界の番長だ！",
   "text": "Boss: I'm this world's Boss!"
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x2924C",
   "original": "子分達が随分と世話になったようだな。",
   "text": "You've been busy with my boys."
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x29274",
   "original": "だが、茶番はここまでだ！",
   "text": "But the farce ends here!"
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x29290",
   "original": "礼をさせてもらうぞ。",
   "text": "Here's my thanks."
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x292A8",
   "original": "これでもくらえぇーい！",
   "text": "Take thiiis!"
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x292C0",
   "original": "超眼力！",
   "text": "Glare!"
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x292CC",
   "original": "番長「ふっ、思い知ったか。",
   "text": "Boss: Heh, learned now?"
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x292E8",
   "original": "俺様に逆らう者の末路はこうなるのだ。",
   "text": "This is how my enemies end up."
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x29310",
   "original": "はっはっはっはっはっ・・・",
   "text": "Hahahahaha..."
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x2932C",
   "original": "天使の声「お願い、立ちあがって。",
   "text": "Angel: Please, stand up."
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x29350",
   "original": "あなたには、",
   "text": "You still"
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x29360",
   "original": "まだやるべきことがあるのよ！",
   "text": "have things to do!"
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x29380",
   "original": "そうよ、あなたにならできるわ！",
   "text": "Yes, you can do it!"
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x293A0",
   "original": "新しい力をあげる。",
   "text": "Take new power."
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x293B4",
   "original": "彼女を・・・守ってあげて！",
   "text": "Protect... her!"
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x293D0",
   "original": "番長「なにぃぃぃー！？",
   "text": "Boss: Whaaat!?"
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x293E8",
   "original": "番長「こわっぱが、",
   "text": "Boss: Brat,"
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x293FC",
   "original": "超眼力を見切った程度で図に乗りおって",
   "text": "you think you're hot, dodging my Glare"
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x29424",
   "original": "俺様の真の力を見せてくれる。",
   "text": "I'll show you my true power."
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/RPG_BAT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x29444",
   "original": "ゆくぞーっ！",
   "text": "Here I come!"
  },
  {
